# G1 Rerun — Timestamped Pre-Registration Artefact

**Purpose:** E3 provenance — the authoritative, dated, before-the-run record of the
G1 pass criteria that actually ran in the 2026-08-05 rerun. Extracted verbatim
from `spike-run.log` (lines 371–377), printed by the spike's own G1 start-up
logging at `2026-08-05T13:22:31.933Z` — i.e. **before** any sample, attribution, or
verdict logic executed (the first attribution sample fired at `13:22:32.042Z`,
~109 ms after this block; the spike's verdict fired at `13:44:32.301Z`).

**Source file:** `/Users/openclaw/projects/BeeChat-v5/Docs/Reviews/optionb/spike-run.log`
**Source lines:** 371–377

